cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this work, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Can GB Battery Declarations Be Audited From Public Data? (Dispatch Realisation of GB Batteries)"
abstract: >-
  Version 1 delivers a preregistered auditability assessment of GB public
  balancing data for verifying battery declarations. It documents two key data
  gaps, tests the proposed checks against synthetic batteries with known
  ground truth, and measures where those checks work, where they fail, and
  why. It reports the fleet-level findings and data limitations, but makes no
  per-unit finding of over- or under-declaration. The open, tested pipeline
  provides a basis for future work with better data or revised methods.
